    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0000",
      "timestamp": 0.0,
      "end_time": 4.08,
      "text": "Welcome to the Videolins 1 Minute Multimodal Demonstration."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0001",
      "timestamp": 4.08,
      "end_time": 11.36,
      "text": "In Section 1, bring water to a rolling boil, then add fresh organic basil and ripe red tomatoes."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0002",
      "timestamp": 11.36,
      "end_time": 15.36,
      "text": "Drizzle cold pressed golden olive oil to finish the dish."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0003",
      "timestamp": 15.36,
      "end_time": 19.72,
      "text": "In Section 2, our autonomous robotics lab begins."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0004",
      "timestamp": 19.72,
      "end_time": 24.04,
      "text": "The rover initializes its 3D lead AR sensor array."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0005",
      "timestamp": 24.04,
      "end_time": 29.44,
      "text": "The robot detects an obstacle at 2 meters and performs a rapid left turn maneuver."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0006",
      "timestamp": 29.68,
      "end_time": 33.2,
      "text": "The rover reaches waypoint Bravo successfully."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0007",
      "timestamp": 33.2,
      "end_time": 39.76,
      "text": "In Section 3, we study Gaussian filtering and 2D convolution kernels for image blur."
    },
    {
      "type": "transcript",
      "id": "9a31b8c8-d5f_t0008",
      "timestamp": 39.76,
      "end_time": 48.4,
      "text": "Finally in Section 4, we use FAS Vector search to index visual and temporal embeddings and ground questions in the video timeline."
    },
